            "text": "/* A surface token rather than a flat grey, so the panel follows the theme. */\n.illustration-panel {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    /* Wide and capped: at a 1440px content column a half-width 4:3 panel is over\n       500px tall and swamps the copy beside it. */\n    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n    max-height: var(--slds-g-sizing-14, 15rem);\n    background: var(--slds-g-color-surface-container-2, #f3f3f3);\n    border: 1px solid var(--slds-g-color-border-1, #e5e5e5);\n    border-radius: var(--slds-g-radius-border-2, 0.25rem);\n}",
