            "text": "/* Job card body spacing — the card's own public body hooks, nothing else.\n *\n * Design: Figma 445:40158 (My jobs), card body 16px left, right and bottom.\n * The body hooks have NO default: the shadow rule is\n * `padding-inline-start: var(--slds-c-card-body-spacing-inlinestart)` with no\n * fallback, so an unset body sits flush against the card border. `block-end`\n * feeds the body's margin, not its padding — the visible result is the same\n * space beneath the content. Top is left to the card's header.\n *\n * Scoped to this wrapper's class, so no other card on the site moves. */\n.vacancy-listing-card__card {\n    --slds-c-card-body-spacing-inline-start: var(--slds-g-spacing-4);\n    --slds-c-card-body-spacing-inline-end: var(--slds-g-spacing-4);\n    --slds-c-card-body-spacing-block-end: var(--slds-g-spacing-4);\n}",
